  designNotes: "2026-08-26, real playtested bug (\"\u6BCF\u6B21\u90FD\u662F\u5288\u780D\u7D50\u675F\u5F8C\u528D\u624D\u7D05\")
    - re-measured against the actual clip via AnimationMode.SampleAnimationClip,
    tracking BladeHitbox's position/speed relative to root every ~0.05s across the
    whole 3.3s clip. The OLD windows (0.445-0.495, 0.72-0.93) both landed in the
    LULL right after each real swing had already finished moving, not during it -
    confirmed by the blade's own speed dropping near 0 during both old windows while
    the real fast cutting motion (peak speed 97 units/s at t=0.182 for swing 1, a
    sustained 20-30 units/s sweep across t=0.59-0.71 for swing 2) had already happened
    earlier. New windows are centered on those two measured fast-swing phases instead.
    Not a guess this time - measured is 1 on both."
